  "label_eligibility": "PFF H/A/D references must be reconstructible from documented source events without predictor dependence; unknown remainsX. References are provider event proxies, not corrected competition tracking. If complete task labels cannot be validated, stop promotion rather than invent D or redefine endpoint after scores.",
